      "text": "salt-master-01 / Fedora arm64 / t4g.small\n\nSalt master + minion + self-hosted runner\nSchedules all-minion highstate every 5 min\nTuneD: aws (EC2) / throughput-performance (GPU)\nTailscale mesh across k3s + bare-metal MLOps\nReceives k3s token via cp.push",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "salt-master-01 / Fedora arm64 / t4g.small\n\nSalt master + minion + self-hosted runner\nSchedules all-minion highstate every 5 min\nTuneD: aws (EC2) / throughput-performance (GPU)\nTailscale mesh across k3s + bare-metal MLOps\nReceives k3s token via cp.push",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "labelPosition": null
